  "critique": {
    "axis": "aesthetics",
    "evidence": "Strong cyber-forensic art direction, crisp typography, restrained cyan/red palette, and a compelling two-tone thesis headline. However, desktop composition is underfilled and visually disconnected, tablet has excessive vertical dead space, and mobile reduces the evidence flow to an undifferentiated card stack. The mobile header also loses the wordmark and visibly clips its horizontal navigation, while several tiny, muted mono labels weaken legibility and polish.",
